Real-ESRGAN weights bundled with this app
==========================================

File: realesr-general-x4v3.onnx
SHA-256: 47710b200e8ea23e90cc4193bd9e6f3302f163db94865673c843dd12e2344b8a

Source weights SHA-256 (realesr-general-x4v3.pth):
8dc7edb9ac80ccdc30c3a5dca6616509367f05fbc184ad95b731f05bece96292

This ONNX model was exported from the official PyTorch weights
realesr-general-x4v3.pth, published by Xintao Wang in the Real-ESRGAN
project:

https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN/releases/download/v0.2.5.0/realesr-general-x4v3.pth

The network is the official compact 4x model (SRVGGNetCompact,
num_feat=64, num_conv=32, upscale=4, PReLU), described as
"realesr-general-x4v3" in that project. It is the small general-scene
x4 model, suitable for running on a phone. The export script in
tools/export_realesrgan_onnx.py reloads those weights and writes this
file. No other project's conversion code is used.

