Inference runtime
=================

The app runs the model with ONNX Runtime for Android
(com.microsoft.onnxruntime:onnxruntime-android). ONNX Runtime is
licensed under the MIT License:

https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime/blob/main/LICENSE

The runtime is fetched as a build dependency. It is not copied from
another gallery or super-resolution application.
